flowchart TD
    subgraph Req ["Krav, GitHub Projects v2 & Træ-isomorfe Branches"]
        direction TB
        Step1["1. GitHub Issue & Projects v2 (Single Source of Truth)
• Opret Issue via form eller gh issue create (status: Spec Ready)
• Validér Gherkin-acceptkriterier for @fullstack / @backend-only / @ui-only"]
        Step2["2. Linked Branch & Fælles specs/features/
• Opret branch feature/<id>-<slug> fra dev (eller fra parent-branch)
• Skriv/synkronisér fælles .feature-kontrakt i specs/features/"]
        Step1 -->|"1. sdlc:sync-issue"| Step2
    end

    subgraph Phase1 ["Fase 1: Backend Vertical Slice Loop (Outside-In / Zero-Mock)"]
        direction TB
        Step3["3. Backend BDD (Outer Loop — Red)
• Eksekvér Cucumber-JVM mod specs/features/ (not @ui-only)
• Resultat: FEJLER (Rød) — manglende slice eller endpoint"]
        Step4["4. Backend TDD (Inner Loop)
• Skriv fejlende JUnit 5 unit-tests oven på BaseDomainCore & BaseWebCore
• Implementér <Name>Feature.java -> BESTÅR (Grøn)"]
        Step5["5. Backend Verifikation & 100 % JaCoCo Gate
• Kør JUnit 5 + Cucumber-JVM (cucumber-report.json)
• Alle 6 JaCoCo-tællere = 100 % -> BESTÅR (Grøn)"]
        Step3 -->|"3. Driver implementation"| Step4
        Step4 -->|"4. Kvalitetssikring"| Step5
    end

    subgraph Phase2 ["Fase 2: Frontend Dual-App & Fælles Kontraktverifikation"]
        direction TB
        Step6["6. Frontend BDD (Outer Loop — Red)
• Kør Cucumber.js mod præcis samme specs/features/
• Eksekvér BFF- & Playwright UI-scenarier -> FEJLER (Rød)"]
        Step7["7. Frontend TDD & 100 % Istanbul Gate
• Implementér <Name>Feature.tsx med 2-fils TypeScript Core
• Vitest + Istanbul: alle 4 metrikker = 100 % -> BESTÅR (Grøn)"]
        Step8["8. Samlet E2E & @spawn-subissue Gate
• Verificér fuldt system (Keycloak, Dual-App, Spring Boot, DB, Kafka)
• Bottom-up @spawn-subissue tjek -> BESTÅR (Grøn)"]
        Step6 -->|"6. Driver React-slice"| Step7
        Step7 -->|"7. End-to-end validering"| Step8
    end

    subgraph Integration ["Integration, Sub-Issue Gating & To-vejs Feedback-Loop"]
        Step9["9. SDLC Full-Stack Gate & Pull Request
• Verificér at alle hierarkiske Sub-Issues er Done
• Merge til parent-branch / dev -> status Done + Living Spec synk
• Ved fremtidig testfejl på @issue-<id> -> status Regression"]
    end

    Step2 -->|"2. Start Backend-loop"| Step3
    Step5 -->|"5. Backend grøn -> Start Frontend-loop"| Step6
    Step8 -->|"8. Alle 100 %-gates & checks grønne"| Step9
    Step9 -.->|"9. Living Spec & Regression feedback"| Step1

